$DATUM Bis(4,5-di(thiophen-2-yl)phenylene) orthocarbonate (5) To the solution of
4 (2.81 g, 5.2 mmol) and 2-(tributylstannyl)thiophene (8.45 g , 22.7
mmol) in 50 ml of dry THF, 50 mg of (tBu3P)2Pd was added under argon. The
mixture was refluxed overnight and then diluted with light petroleum
ether. White solid formed was separated by filtration, washed with light
petroleum ether, methanol and dried in vacuum at 50 °C. 2.59 g of 5. The
compound was used for further synthesis without purification.
